# Introduction

This is the CICADA fork of the statistics Plugin for Dokuwiki, based on the 2026-01-16 update version.  The primary purpose of this fork is to prune some redundant/unnecessary tracking information for project and compliance purposes.

## CHANGES FROM ORIGINAL PLUGIN:

- Added "advancedanon" option in settings.  When enabled, this option will replace most user/session identifiers with dummy values.  IPs will still be tracked for the purposes of determining unique visitors, so other anonymizing feataures should be used in conjunction with this option as needed.

